The AscendC kernels under terrace/ops/ascendc/ follow the three-stage
(CopyIn/Compute/CopyOut) programming paradigm demonstrated by the
"AddCustom" operator sample in the Ascend samples repository
(https://gitee.com/ascend/samples), Copyright Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd.,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The kernel implementations
in this repository were written independently; structural idioms and
identifier conventions (e.g. the VECIN/VECOUT queue pairing) follow the
platform's documented programming model.
